items/thm-sequential-criterion-for-function-limits.md:83:1.1 Assume condition 1, let $(x_k)$ be a sequence with $x_k \in A$ and $x_k \ne c$ for every $k$ and $x_k \to c$, and let $\varepsilon > 0$ be an arbitrary real. [assume-hyp, L1, L2]
