+errors were closed.
+
+The audit content-policy gate reports 18 expected errors, all caused by the
+four deliberately untagged A3 deferrals, and four warnings: the two generated
+Remarks lack a `generation.role`, and the two already-recorded generated-target
+dependency situations remain. The full dependency gate reports the eight
